OL,3,GNEWSARed Arrows cancel flypast amid
OL,4,Athunderstorms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Red Arrows have been forced to
OL,7,Fcancel their planned flypast for
OL,8,FSidmouth Regatta due to poor weather
OL,9,Fconditions.
OL,11,FThe RAF aerobatic team were due to
OL,12,Fappear over Sidmouth and Lyme Regis
OL,13,Fearlier this evening, weeks after being
OL,14,Fstranded in Canada due to bad weather.
OL,16,FIn a statement, a spokesperson said
OL,17,Fthunderstorm conditions at the team's
OL,18,Foperating base in RAF Mildenhall had
OL,19,F"temporarily prevented the take-off for
OL,20,Fthe transit to Liverpool during which
OL,21,Fthe two flypasts were planned".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
